## Title: Satchel Exchange
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.9.3
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: Press Talk, get the goods: auto-opens the store from dialogue, buys one satchel, exits, and unboxes it, re-arming across visits. Works with any satchel vendor (e.g. Dremora Vendor Tur). Tip: use Gameplay Template B so you can interact faster without jumping.
## SavedVariables: SatchelExchangeSavedVars
## ConsoleDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings
## OptionalDependsOn: LibConsoleLogger
## DevId: 979371c6-2e58-4b2f-84af-cc9276c86b94
## ProdId: 979371c6-2e58-4b2f-84af-cc9276c86b94

